                           <p>Script: dpe tshugs.&#13;
Orthography:&#13;
- Abundant use of abbreviations (e.g., ye shes, phyag ’tshal lo, gzugs, final –gs, etc.)&#13;
- Bindu for m&#13;
- Numerals used for numbers and for phonetic value (e.g., 4+n for bzhin)&#13;
Interlinear insertions in smaller script on f. 1b6, f. 2a2 and f. 2a3 (titles for groups of verses) and a few corrections.</p>
